#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:9
msgid "What I do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:11
msgid ""
"Generate a comprehensive project health report that aggregates pulse, "
"velocity, drift, coverage, and suggestions into a single document. This "
"is the \"CTO dashboard\" in document form — a report that gives "
"leadership visibility without them needing to learn CLI commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:16
msgid "When to use me"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:18
msgid ""
"When the user says \"give me a report\", \"what's the state of things\", "
"\"prepare an update for the team\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:20
msgid "At the end of a sprint for a retrospective summary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:21
msgid "When onboarding a new team member who needs the big picture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:23
msgid "How to generate the report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:25
msgid "Run these commands and aggregate the output:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:27
msgid ""
"`hero sprint status --week` — sprint health (done, in-flight, at-risk, "
"drift)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:28
msgid "`hero sprint velocity --since 30d` — delivery velocity by agent/engineer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:29
msgid "`hero drift --in-flight` — current spec-vs-code divergence"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:30
msgid "`hero suggest --top 5` — high-churn areas without specs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:31
msgid "`hero search --list --status planning` — backlog size"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:32
msgid "`hero search --list --status delivering` — WIP count"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:33
msgid "`hero spec contract check` — regression status across delivered specs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:35
msgid "Report format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:37
msgid "Write the report to `.hero/reports/report-<date>.md`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:39
msgid ""
"# Project Intelligence Report — <date>\n"
"\n"
"## Health summary\n"
"- N specs completed this sprint, N in-flight, N at risk\n"
"- Delivery velocity: N specs/week (trend: up/down/flat)\n"
"- Drift: N specs with warnings, N boundary violations\n"
"- Contract coverage: N/M criteria verified, N regressions\n"
"\n"
"## What shipped\n"
"<from pulse — done specs with titles>\n"
"\n"
"## What's at risk\n"
"<from pulse — at-risk specs with staleness>\n"
"<from drift — specs with warnings>\n"
"\n"
"## Where attention is needed\n"
"<from suggestions — high-churn uncovered areas>\n"
"<from contract check — any regressions>\n"
"\n"
"## Backlog\n"
"N specs in planning, N in review\n"
"Top priorities: <list top 3 by priority>\n"
"\n"
"## Velocity trend\n"
"<from velocity — per-agent metrics>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:67
msgid "What not to do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:69
msgid "Don't editorialize or add opinions — report facts from Hero data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:70
msgid "Don't include full spec content — link to slugs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/executive-report/SKILL.md:71
msgid "Don't require external data — everything comes from Hero commands"
msgstr ""

